                        %mi λ
                        %mo ⊲
                        %mi κ
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \lambda\lhd\kappa
          %p
            In particular, for any accessible functor
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi F
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F
            there are arbitrarily large cardinals
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi κ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \kappa
            such that
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi F
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F
            is
            = succeed "-accessible," do
