            %p
          %p
          .num_theorem
            %h6 Theorem
            %p
              Assuming the existence of a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proper+class"} proper class
              of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strongly+compact+cardinals"} strongly compact cardinals
          %p
            The existence of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proper+class"} proper class
